### ============================================
### Dependencies - Header Validation
### ============================================

### 1. Valid X-Token and X-Key - expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/
X-Token: fake-super-secret-token
X-Key: fake-super-secret-key

###

### 2. Missing both headers - expect 422
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/

###

### 3. Invalid headers - expect 400
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/
X-Token: invalid-token
X-Key: invalid-key